<title>JAPAN: Fujirebio - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujirebio - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.93		vs	   11.63</p>
<p> Operating	  702    million	  vs	  637    million</p>
<p> Current	    802    million	  vs	  779    million</p>
<p> Net		  429    million	  vs	  364    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.07 yen	  vs	    8.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     43 million	  vs	  43 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujirebio Inc is a maker of diagnostic drugs, especially in the immune serum field.</p>
</text>
